---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title='态度 · Stance · wo/men in tech'
  description='women in tech · 在杭州的巷子与山径之间，做经得起时间的事。'
  width='reading'
>
  <article class='ethos'>
    <header class='ethos-head'>
      <span class='eyebrow'>STANCE</span>
      <h1 lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>态度</h1>
      <h1 lang='en' class='lang-en'>Stance</h1>
      <p class='value'>
        <span lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>在杭州的巷子与山径之间，<br />做经得起时间的事。</span>
        <span lang='en' class='lang-en'>In Hangzhou's alleys and hill trails,<br />making work that endures.</span>
      </p>
    </header>

    <span class='rule' aria-hidden='true'></span>

    <section class='manifesto'>
      <div lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>
        <p>商业之外，一方余地。<br />给值得署名的事。</p>
        <p>在此成形。</p>
      </div>
      <div lang='en' class='lang-en'>
        <p>Beyond commerce, a room of one's own—<br />for work worth signing.</p>
        <p>Where it takes shape.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <span class='rule' aria-hidden='true'></span>

    <section class='who'>
      <span class='eyebrow'>
        <span lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>面向群体</span>
        <span lang='en' class='lang-en'>Crafted For</span>
      </span>
      <div lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>
        <p>手艺人、设计师、工程师、艺术工作者、工作室主、写作者——以作品署名，不在机构里。</p>
        <p class='quiet'>无需头衔。<br />作品即署名。</p>
      </div>
      <div lang='en' class='lang-en'>
        <p>Artisans, designers, engineers, artists, studio owners, writers—signed by the work, not the institution.</p>
        <p class='quiet'>No title required.<br />The work is the signature.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <span class='rule' aria-hidden='true'></span>

    <section class='principles'>
      <p lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>少做，做久，留余地，署其名。</p>
      <p lang='en' class='lang-en'>Do less. Last longer. Leave room. Sign it.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .ethos {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--spacing-20) 0 var(--spacing-24);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-8);
  }

  .ethos-head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: var(--spacing-3); }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .ethos-head h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-light);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .value {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: var(--spacing-2) 0 0;
    max-width: 30rem;
  }

  .rule {
    display: block;
    width: var(--spacing-8);
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-gold-dust);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .manifesto p,
  .who p {
    font-family: var(--font-family-sans);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  .manifesto p:last-child,
  .who p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .manifesto p:last-child,
  .who p.quiet { color: var(--color-text-tertiary); font-size: 13.5px; }

  .who { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: var(--spacing-3); }
  .who .eyebrow { color: var(--color-text-tertiary); }

  .principles p {
    font-family: var(--font-family-sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .ethos { padding: var(--spacing-16) 0 var(--spacing-20); gap: var(--spacing-6); }
    .ethos-head h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
    .value { font-size: 14px; }
  }
</style>
